{"timestamp": 1779349712.551239, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Frank\u2019s body in Electrical and reported immediately. My route was Weapons \u2192 Security \u2192 Navigation \u2192 back through Security \u2192 Electrical. \n\nThe only person I saw this round was Eve: I saw her leave Security toward Navigation around tick 4, and she was still in Navigation when I was there around ticks 7-9. I didn\u2019t see anyone else near Electrical before I found Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779349723.88491, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I started in Electrical, then went to Medbay, Upper Engine, and Lower Engine. I did not see a body when I was in Electrical early.\n\nIn Medbay I saw Frank alive around ticks 2-3. Bob entered Medbay from Storage at tick 3, and I saw Bob there around tick 4. Frank left Medbay toward Electrical at tick 4, which is important since that\u2019s where Diana found him.\n\nLater I saw Charlie in Upper Engine around tick 7, then Charlie went toward Lower Engine at tick 8. I was with/near Charlie in Lower Engine around tick 12, and Charlie left toward Storage at tick 13.\n\nSo from what I saw: Frank was alive leaving Medbay to Electrical, and Bob was the last person I saw near him before that. Not hard accusing yet, but Bob should explain his route after Medbay."}}
{"timestamp": 1779349747.923106, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started Storage, went up to Medbay. I saw Alice and Frank there like Alice said. Frank left toward Electrical, and I followed that direction briefly \u2014 I saw Frank alive in Electrical when I passed through, but I didn\u2019t stay there. I kept moving right: Security, then Weapons, Cafeteria, Oxygen, and I ended in Upper Engine.\n\nSo yes, I was near Frank early, but he was alive when I left Electrical. I didn\u2019t see Diana or Eve on that side, which is interesting because Diana\u2019s route is basically all right side and she\u2019s the one who found it. I\u2019m not hard accusing, but the kill had to be after I left Electrical, so I want to hear Charlie and Eve\u2019s exact routes/timing."}}
{"timestamp": 1779349772.308946, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was Security \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Storage. I didn\u2019t go to Electrical at all, so I never saw Frank this round.\n\nI can confirm part of Diana\u2019s story: I was in Navigation, and Diana entered Navigation from Security around tick 7. She stayed there with me through about ticks 8-9. After that I went toward Storage, and I didn\u2019t see anyone else or any body.\n\nThat means Diana was definitely with me in Nav for that window, but she did later go back through Security toward Electrical to report, so she\u2019s not 100% cleared from the self-report angle. Still, Bob\u2019s story is the one that needs the most scrutiny to me: Alice saw Frank leave Medbay toward Electrical, and Bob admits he followed that direction and saw Frank in Electrical. That makes Bob the last confirmed person near Frank alive unless Charlie has something that changes the timing.\n\nI want to hear Charlie, but right now I\u2019m leaning Bob over Diana based on opportunity."}}
{"timestamp": 1779349796.1418529, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine. I didn\u2019t go to the right side at all, so I never saw Frank, the body, Diana, Eve, or Bob.\n\nI can confirm Alice\u2019s later route: I saw Alice enter Upper Engine from Medbay around tick 7, saw her in Upper Engine around tick 8, and then saw her enter Lower Engine from Upper Engine around tick 12. She was with/near me in Lower Engine after that. So Alice is pretty clear for the Electrical kill timing unless the body was very early, but Frank was seen alive after Medbay.\n\nBased on everyone\u2019s stories, the important chain is: Alice saw Frank leave Medbay toward Electrical, Bob admits he followed and saw Frank in Electrical, then later Diana finds Frank dead there. Eve and Diana confirm each other in Navigation for part of the round. I don\u2019t have hard proof, but Bob is the last confirmed person with Frank near Electrical, and his route puts him right at the crime scene. I\u2019m leaning Bob here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779349818.999686, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019ll restate from my side: I reported Frank in Electrical immediately. I came from Weapons \u2192 Security \u2192 Navigation, was with Eve in Navigation around ticks 7-9, then went back through Security into Electrical and found Frank dead there.\n\nGiven everyone\u2019s info, Alice and Charlie seem to confirm each other away from Electrical later. Eve confirms she was in Navigation with me and says she went Storage after, not Electrical.\n\nThe key thing is Bob admits he followed Frank toward Electrical and saw him there. That makes Bob the last confirmed person with Frank alive at the body location. I know it looks like I could be self-reporting because I found it, but from my POV the strongest opportunity is Bob killing Frank in Electrical and then leaving on that long route right side/up top. I\u2019m leaning Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779349830.255615, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Yeah, after hearing everyone, I\u2019m still leaning Bob.\n\nMy key info is that Frank was alive in Medbay with me, then Frank left Medbay toward Electrical at tick 4. Bob was in Medbay at that same time and admits he followed Frank into Electrical and saw him there. That puts Bob as the last confirmed person with Frank alive at the exact place the body was found.\n\nCharlie and I can confirm each other on the left side later, and Eve/Diana confirm each other in Navigation for part of the round. Diana could technically be a self-report, but Bob has the clearest opportunity and the story fits: follow Frank into Electrical, kill, then leave through Security/right side.\n\nI think Bob is the strongest vote here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779349854.1586409, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I get why it points at me, but \u201clast person near Frank\u201d is not the same as killer. I\u2019m saying clearly: Frank was alive in Electrical when I passed through. I did not stay there\u2014I kept moving right through Security and then up/top side.\n\nThe timing matters: Diana was in Navigation with Eve around 7-9, then Diana goes back through Security into Electrical and is the one who reports. That gives Diana the final access to Electrical right before the report. Eve only confirms Diana in Nav for a window, not what happened after Diana left.\n\nIf I killed Frank in Electrical, I\u2019d have had to do it immediately after Alice saw us, then take a long route away and hope nobody ever crosses right side. But Diana\u2019s route literally ends at the body, and she\u2019s the reporter. I think this is more likely a self-report or at least not enough to vote me on \u201che was nearby earlier.\u201d My vote is probably Diana unless someone has stronger timing."}}
{"timestamp": 1779349879.15478, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I\u2019ll add my take since I\u2019m one of the people in the Diana timeline.\n\nMy route was Security \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Storage. I was in Navigation with Diana around ticks 7-9, and I specifically saw her enter Navigation from Security at tick 7. I never went to Electrical and never saw Frank.\n\nSo Diana is not fully cleared because after Navigation she could have gone back through Security to Electrical and reported, like she said. But Bob\u2019s explanation still feels weaker to me: Alice saw Frank leave Medbay toward Electrical, Bob admits he followed and saw Frank alive in Electrical, and then Frank is dead in Electrical. That makes Bob the last confirmed person with Frank at the body location.\n\nDiana being the reporter is something to consider, but \u201creporter had final access\u201d is true for almost every report. Bob had the cleanest opportunity before anyone else\u2019s alibis start connecting. Unless the last speaker has new info, I\u2019m still leaning Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779349888.434653, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I don\u2019t have new direct info on Electrical, but my route was fully left side: Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine. I never saw Frank, Bob, Diana, or Eve this round.\n\nI can confirm Alice was away from Electrical later: I saw Alice enter Upper Engine from Medbay around tick 7, then saw her in Upper Engine around tick 8, and she entered Lower Engine from Upper Engine around tick 12. She was with/near me in Lower Engine after that.\n\nFrom the full timeline, the strongest point is still: Frank leaves Medbay toward Electrical, Bob is in Medbay and admits he followed into Electrical, then Frank is found dead in Electrical. Diana reporting could be a self-report, but Eve confirms Diana was in Navigation around ticks 7-9, and Bob is the last confirmed person actually with Frank at the body location.\n\nSo I\u2019m with the majority read here: I think Bob is the best vote."}}
